		{
			description: [
				"&7Looking to upgrade your storage game? The &lIron Chests&r mod has your back — and your barrels!"
				""
				"&7From the humble &odirt chest&r (for when you're really down bad) to the shimmering &lcrystal&r and mighty &lnetherite&r chests, there's a perfect upgrade for every stage of your journey. Each tier offers more space than the last, so you’ll never run out of room for all your mushrooms, gears, and cozy clutter."
				""
				"&7Not into boxes? No problem. &lBarrels&r are also included — giving you stylish, vertical storage options that still pack a punch in capacity!"
				""
				"&l洋娃娃时间！&r 🛞"
				"想移动箱子又不想清空里面的东西？制作一个&oDolly&r或&oUpgraded Diamond Dolly&r，只需&l右击&r箱子即可拾起——在目的地&oshift-点击&r放置。所有物品都安全留在箱内，整理和搬迁都变得轻松无比！"
				""
				"&l保持安全！ 🔐&r"
				"想保护你的珍贵战利品吗？使用&l锁&r和&l钥匙&r来保护你的箱子免受不速之客的侵扰。非常适合多人游戏，或者仅仅是为了保护你最喜欢的藏宝免受……你自己的侵扰。"
				""
				"&7With Iron Chests, you’ll never run out of storage or style. Upgrade wisely, organize beautifully, and store like a pro!"
			]
			icon: "ironchests:diamond_chest"
			id: "7DF4A71CE3985EE9"
